---
const { active = false } = Astro.props;
const HeadingTag = active ? 'h1' : 'p';
---
<section class:list={["feature-workflow-panel","approval-page"].concat(active ? ['is-active'] : [])} data-feature-panel="ApproveDesign" hidden={!active}>
<section class="approval-hero">
    <div class="approval-hero-copy">
      <HeadingTag data-feature-heading class="feature-kicker">Artwork approval software for promotional products</HeadingTag>
      <h2>One link. One clear <strong>decision.</strong></h2>
      <p class="feature-lede">Share artwork through a secure online approval link. Customers can review mockups, approve designs, request revisions, and leave comments without endless email chains.</p>
      <div class="feature-actions"><a class="feature-primary" href="/contact">Talk to Sales ↗</a></div>
    </div>
    <figure class="approval-hero-image">
      <img src="/assets/features/approval-portal/approval-review-inline.png" alt="Client reviewing the branded PromoPlus hoodie mockup">
      <span class="approval-pin pin-one">Comment</span><span class="approval-pin pin-two">Approve</span>
      <div class="approval-hero-story"><small>Client decision</small><b>Review → Comment → Approve</b></div>
      <figcaption><span>One review link</span><strong>One recorded decision</strong></figcaption>
    </figure>
  </section>

  <section class="approval-problem feature-shell">
    <p class="feature-kicker">Feedback without the chase</p>
    <h2>Stop turning client decisions into email archaeology.</h2>
    <div class="approval-problem-grid">
      <article><span>12:08</span><p>“Can you make the logo a little larger?”</p><small>Email reply</small></article>
      <article><span>12:21</span><p>“Which mockup are we reviewing?”</p><small>Forwarded thread</small></article>
      <article><span>13:04</span><p>“Approved!”</p><small>Missing version context</small></article>
      <div><b>PromoPlus keeps every comment and decision attached to the exact mockup.</b></div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="approval-demo" id="approval-demo">
    <div class="approval-demo-copy">
      <p class="feature-kicker">Interactive approval review</p>
      <h2>Everything the client needs. Nothing they don’t.</h2>
      <p>Select a feedback pin, review the note, then move the mockup from In Review to Approved.</p>
      <div class="approval-state"><span id="approval-state-dot"></span><b id="approval-state-label">In Review</b><small id="approval-state-detail">2 comments open</small></div>
    </div>
    <div class="approval-screen">
      <div class="approval-screen-top"><span>White Hoodie Campaign / V3</span><b id="approval-screen-status">In Review</b></div>
      <div class="approval-product">
        <img class="approval-product-image" src="/assets/features/approval-portal/approval-review-inline.png" alt="Branded PromoPlus hoodie mockup under client review">
        <button class="review-pin review-pin-one is-active" type="button" data-comment="0" aria-label="Open comment one">1</button>
        <button class="review-pin review-pin-two" type="button" data-comment="1" aria-label="Open comment two">2</button>
      </div>
      <aside class="approval-comment" aria-live="polite">
        <small id="comment-author">Sarah / Client</small>
        <p id="comment-copy">Can we move the artwork slightly higher?</p>
        <span id="comment-meta">Front · Placement</span>
      </aside>
      <div class="approval-actions">
        <button type="button" id="request-change">Request revision</button>
        <button type="button" id="approve-design">Approve design <span>✓</span></button>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="approval-record">
    <div class="feature-shell">
      <p class="feature-kicker">Every approval is recorded</p>
      <h2>A decision your team can verify.</h2>
      <div class="record-line"><span>Customer</span><b>Approved V3</b><time>Jun 16, 2026 · 5:37 PM</time><i>Recorded</i></div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="related-features feature-shell">
    <p class="feature-kicker">Connected features</p>
    <div class="related-grid pp-related-pair">
      <a class="approval-related-link" href="/features/artwork-version-control"><small>Review the right revision with</small><h3>Artwork Version Control</h3><p>Keep each revision clear before it reaches the client.</p><span>Explore feature ↗</span></a>
      <a class="approval-related-link" href="/features/production-ready-file-generation"><small>Send the approved design to</small><h3>Production Ready Files</h3><p>Turn the approved mockup and artwork into a clear production handoff.</p><span>Explore feature ↗</span></a>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="feature-final-cta" id="approval-cta">
    <div class="pp-cta-copy"><p class="feature-kicker">One link. One decision.</p><h2>Ready to make client approvals easier?</h2></div><a class="feature-primary" href="/contact">Talk to Sales ↗</a></section>
</section>
